{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play as a god, see, hear, and smell through your Chosen One and steer Jilong evolution with four DNA sets, miracles, and karma.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras/9c8faa28cd877c885565add0f773fbbc.avif?t=1771984131\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras_big/9c8faa28cd877c885565add0f773fbbc.webp?t=1771984131 width=1560 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras/7e61bfad0e680affd4e5e90e79c4b54b.poster.avif?t=1771984131\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras/7e61bfad0e680affd4e5e90e79c4b54b.webm?t=1771984131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras/7e61bfad0e680affd4e5e90e79c4b54b.mp4?t=1771984131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your actions shape karma, and karma shapes how the world responds to your tribe. Karma comes in two forms, Love and Strong, and each reflects a different kind of divine influence. The balance between them changes how the Jilongs live and evolve, how the world responds, and how the game adapts its challenge, pacing, and threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras/3712a0c3ce530d2d00a235670a295b6d.avif?t=1771984131\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras_big/3712a0c3ce530d2d00a235670a295b6d.webp?t=1771984131 width=1560 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miracles are your primary tools for shaping the world. These divine interventions come at a cost. Each miracle both shapes karma and is shaped by it, creating a feedback loop between your actions and the world\u2019s response.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras/cf6bd18803c824b1a5d4addd51268b67.avif?t=1771984131\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras_big/cf6bd18803c824b1a5d4addd51268b67.webp?t=1771984131 width=1560 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Direct the evolution of the Jilongs, equipping them to survive and flourish in the demanding environment of the Stone Age.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras/8c93739e7c11cc8453fe9dd9be960f13.avif?t=1771984131\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras_big/8c93739e7c11cc8453fe9dd9be960f13.webp?t=1771984131 width=1560 height=1410 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras/eb255fea2a4d47a3f521b618389a9feb.avif?t=1771984131\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras_big/eb255fea2a4d47a3f521b618389a9feb.webp?t=1771984131 width=1560 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jilongs inherit four DNA sets, and offspring traits emerge from their combinations. By choosing parents intentionally, you can shape traits across generations and steer your tribe\u2019s evolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras/cd5f0f55b517d9ecf2251bdf30b1ac1a.avif?t=1771984131\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras_big/cd5f0f55b517d9ecf2251bdf30b1ac1a.webp?t=1771984131 width=1560 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select a single Jilong as your Chosen One, your direct connection to the world. Their eyes, ears, and nose become your senses, letting you explore, detect threats, and decide when to intervene. A Chosen One with weak senses limits what you can perceive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras/5f0a362360e1178885303d244747b83c.avif?t=1771984131\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras_big/5f0a362360e1178885303d244747b83c.webp?t=1771984131 width=1560 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can unlock perks to access new buildings and miracles. Some unlocks empower what Jilongs can build directly, while others expand what you can shape through miracles. Perks let players define their style of guidance and grow into their full potential as a god.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras/6c2c174cb2e34f033c4000554f40fde9.avif?t=1771984131\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras_big/6c2c174cb2e34f033c4000554f40fde9.webp?t=1771984131 width=1560 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horn type, skin color, organ count, and organ health all impact capabilities and performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras/1f6c3f25fe3715592c15276da31fbab0.avif?t=1771984131\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras_big/1f6c3f25fe3715592c15276da31fbab0.webp?t=1771984131 width=1560 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jilongs are worm-like creatures born deep underground, where darkness shaped their weak sight and vibrant colors. They evolved the Fourth Sense, a telekinetic ability that lets them sense and move objects without limbs. Now in the harsh but lively Stone Age, their survival and evolution depend on their traits, the world around them, and your divine guidance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras/90ddfb597cc56bb5fe064323fd978cb7.avif?t=1771984131\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras_big/90ddfb597cc56bb5fe064323fd978cb7.webp?t=1771984131 width=1560 height=1119 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras/371b37347118724938496742a3e8dd50.avif?t=1771984131\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras_big/371b37347118724938496742a3e8dd50.webp?t=1771984131 width=1560 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect your Jilong tribe from adversity, from natural disasters and diseases to foe invasions. A god without followers is no god at all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras/78de19d258bef61cb1b19bdf8785ef8b.poster.avif?t=1771984131\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras/78de19d258bef61cb1b19bdf8785ef8b.webm?t=1771984131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras/78de19d258bef61cb1b19bdf8785ef8b.mp4?t=1771984131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras/05a6fe5218caf864e3a0bc5dbc7fa95c.avif?t=1771984131\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras_big/05a6fe5218caf864e3a0bc5dbc7fa95c.webp?t=1771984131 width=1560 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a god of Jilongs, your role is to broaden your influence, establishing and enhancing your religious presence within the game world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras/1153cfab1548677dcc23a366ed9147ad.poster.avif?t=1771984131\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras/1153cfab1548677dcc23a366ed9147ad.webm?t=1771984131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras/1153cfab1548677dcc23a366ed9147ad.mp4?t=1771984131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras/52daf69a8e8cbafcecb6e068c04a6adc.avif?t=1771984131\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras_big/52daf69a8e8cbafcecb6e068c04a6adc.webp?t=1771984131 width=1560 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In \u201cThe Fourth Sense Evolution,\u201d perfection is subjective. Every DNA trait has both strengths and weaknesses. For example, a condition that shortens life in one environment may provide resilience in another.<strong> </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This philosophy ensures there are no absolute \u201cgood\u201d or \u201cbad\u201d choices, only trade-offs that shape your tribe\u2019s path. Each Jilong tribe becomes unique, with its own culture, strengths, and vulnerabilities.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2618390?t=1771984131","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771984131","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771984131","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771984131","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play as a god, see, hear, and smell through your Chosen One and steer Jilong evolution with four DNA sets, miracles, and karma.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras/9c8faa28cd877c885565add0f773fbbc.avif?t=1771984131\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras_big/9c8faa28cd877c885565add0f773fbbc.webp?t=1771984131 width=1560 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras/7e61bfad0e680affd4e5e90e79c4b54b.poster.avif?t=1771984131\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras/7e61bfad0e680affd4e5e90e79c4b54b.webm?t=1771984131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras/7e61bfad0e680affd4e5e90e79c4b54b.mp4?t=1771984131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your actions shape karma, and karma shapes how the world responds to your tribe. Karma comes in two forms, Love and Strong, and each reflects a different kind of divine influence. The balance between them changes how the Jilongs live and evolve, how the world responds, and how the game adapts its challenge, pacing, and threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras/3712a0c3ce530d2d00a235670a295b6d.avif?t=1771984131\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras_big/3712a0c3ce530d2d00a235670a295b6d.webp?t=1771984131 width=1560 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miracles are your primary tools for shaping the world. These divine interventions come at a cost. Each miracle both shapes karma and is shaped by it, creating a feedback loop between your actions and the world\u2019s response.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras/cf6bd18803c824b1a5d4addd51268b67.avif?t=1771984131\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras_big/cf6bd18803c824b1a5d4addd51268b67.webp?t=1771984131 width=1560 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Direct the evolution of the Jilongs, equipping them to survive and flourish in the demanding environment of the Stone Age.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras/8c93739e7c11cc8453fe9dd9be960f13.avif?t=1771984131\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras_big/8c93739e7c11cc8453fe9dd9be960f13.webp?t=1771984131 width=1560 height=1410 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras/eb255fea2a4d47a3f521b618389a9feb.avif?t=1771984131\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras_big/eb255fea2a4d47a3f521b618389a9feb.webp?t=1771984131 width=1560 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jilongs inherit four DNA sets, and offspring traits emerge from their combinations. By choosing parents intentionally, you can shape traits across generations and steer your tribe\u2019s evolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras/cd5f0f55b517d9ecf2251bdf30b1ac1a.avif?t=1771984131\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras_big/cd5f0f55b517d9ecf2251bdf30b1ac1a.webp?t=1771984131 width=1560 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select a single Jilong as your Chosen One, your direct connection to the world. Their eyes, ears, and nose become your senses, letting you explore, detect threats, and decide when to intervene. A Chosen One with weak senses limits what you can perceive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras/5f0a362360e1178885303d244747b83c.avif?t=1771984131\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras_big/5f0a362360e1178885303d244747b83c.webp?t=1771984131 width=1560 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can unlock perks to access new buildings and miracles. Some unlocks empower what Jilongs can build directly, while others expand what you can shape through miracles. Perks let players define their style of guidance and grow into their full potential as a god.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras/6c2c174cb2e34f033c4000554f40fde9.avif?t=1771984131\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras_big/6c2c174cb2e34f033c4000554f40fde9.webp?t=1771984131 width=1560 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horn type, skin color, organ count, and organ health all impact capabilities and performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras/1f6c3f25fe3715592c15276da31fbab0.avif?t=1771984131\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras_big/1f6c3f25fe3715592c15276da31fbab0.webp?t=1771984131 width=1560 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jilongs are worm-like creatures born deep underground, where darkness shaped their weak sight and vibrant colors. They evolved the Fourth Sense, a telekinetic ability that lets them sense and move objects without limbs. Now in the harsh but lively Stone Age, their survival and evolution depend on their traits, the world around them, and your divine guidance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras/90ddfb597cc56bb5fe064323fd978cb7.avif?t=1771984131\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras_big/90ddfb597cc56bb5fe064323fd978cb7.webp?t=1771984131 width=1560 height=1119 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras/371b37347118724938496742a3e8dd50.avif?t=1771984131\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras_big/371b37347118724938496742a3e8dd50.webp?t=1771984131 width=1560 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect your Jilong tribe from adversity, from natural disasters and diseases to foe invasions. A god without followers is no god at all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras/78de19d258bef61cb1b19bdf8785ef8b.poster.avif?t=1771984131\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras/78de19d258bef61cb1b19bdf8785ef8b.webm?t=1771984131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras/78de19d258bef61cb1b19bdf8785ef8b.mp4?t=1771984131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras/05a6fe5218caf864e3a0bc5dbc7fa95c.avif?t=1771984131\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras_big/05a6fe5218caf864e3a0bc5dbc7fa95c.webp?t=1771984131 width=1560 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a god of Jilongs, your role is to broaden your influence, establishing and enhancing your religious presence within the game world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras/1153cfab1548677dcc23a366ed9147ad.poster.avif?t=1771984131\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras/1153cfab1548677dcc23a366ed9147ad.webm?t=1771984131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras/1153cfab1548677dcc23a366ed9147ad.mp4?t=1771984131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras/52daf69a8e8cbafcecb6e068c04a6adc.avif?t=1771984131\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/extras_big/52daf69a8e8cbafcecb6e068c04a6adc.webp?t=1771984131 width=1560 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In \u201cThe Fourth Sense Evolution,\u201d perfection is subjective. Every DNA trait has both strengths and weaknesses. For example, a condition that shortens life in one environment may provide resilience in another.<strong> </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This philosophy ensures there are no absolute \u201cgood\u201d or \u201cbad\u201d choices, only trade-offs that shape your tribe\u2019s path. Each Jilong tribe becomes unique, with its own culture, strengths, and vulnerabilities.</p>","developers":["Soft Bulb Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618390/header.jpg?t=1771984131","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2618390/1130876670/a530d4d54b73236ea66a8b3fcf9e913ef8d3281b/1756759699/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756761397","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2618390/1130876670/a5